<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Lend Lease to buy back 1 pct of stock.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Lend Lease to buy back 1 pct of stock.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurance and property group Lend Lease Corp Ltd said on Friday it would start an on-market share buy-back scheme to buy back 0.969 percent of Lend Lease shares.  </p>
<p>The company said the maximum number of shares it was entitled to buy back under the scheme was about 2.44 million.</p>
<p>It said buying would commence on February 17 and finish on May 16, 1997.</p>
<p>Lend Lease said Sydney broker Ord Minnett Securities had been appointed to buy the shares.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
